FrSt Cast.
Stealthily come for you,
With rod and line for you;
And red and white fly for you;


Brilliant beauty, you.


Second Cast
BY the dark chasm l cast for you,
And then there's a fiutter for you;
Then lift and drop them for you;


Dazzling beauty, you.


Third Cast.
The featherly lure will not bring you;
he downy drop not arouse you;
Pray tell me where I'll fad you?


Peerless beauty, you.


Fourth Cast.
Red. white and blue I've sent to you;
VIII nothing but worm DO you?
You naughty and greedy thing you;


Rainbow beauty, you


Fifth Cast.
An! you have come at last, have you?
Now fight for your life, will you?
All! into the net have you;


Captured beauty you.

